{"id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-strongly-minimal-set.md","title":"Strongly Minimal Set","display":"df-strongly-minimal-set — Strongly Minimal Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-strongly-minimal-set","aliases":["17-df-strongly-minimal-set"],"display":"df-strongly-minimal-set — Strongly Minimal Set","depends_on":["[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-substructure]]","[[17-df-type]]","[[17-df-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-parameter-definable-set]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-7.1.1b","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-strongly-minimal-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-strongly-minimal-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strongly-minimal-set — Strongly Minimal Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"92c5e247a43bafd2\" href=\"?note=92c5e247a43bafd2\" title=\"17-df-parameter-definable-set\">17-df-parameter-definable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.1.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\">\\(\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\)</span> 仅用于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(X\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(Y)\\)</span> 的候选集合满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(Y\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>。集合有限性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有限元组满足记号采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>；合并参数元组时按显示顺序作有限序列拼接。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(D\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_L\">\\(\\preceq_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"71ede582cb78a069\" href=\"?note=71ede582cb78a069\" title=\"17-df-elementary-substructure\">17-df-elementary-substructure</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Form}_{L,n}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\langle b\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\langle b\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"ec1305482f8eec2e\" href=\"?note=ec1305482f8eec2e\" title=\"17-df-satisfaction\">17-df-satisfaction</a> 的参数满足关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak B|^1)\">\\(\\operatorname{Def}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak B|^1)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"92c5e247a43bafd2\" href=\"?note=92c5e247a43bafd2\" title=\"17-df-parameter-definable-set\">17-df-parameter-definable-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 取既有集合有限性谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}\">\\(D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}\\)</span> 的每个合法输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,1+m}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,1+m}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak B|^m\">\\(\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak B|^m\\)</span>；满足元组顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b\\rangle\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\bar c\">\\(\\langle b\\rangle\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\bar c\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UnDef}_1, D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}\">\\(\\operatorname{UnDef}_1, D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}\\)</span> 在此定义。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\n&amp;=\\left\\{\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak B|:\\langle b\\rangle\\in E\\}:E\\in\\operatorname{Def}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\right\\},\\\\\nD_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}\n&amp;=\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak B|:\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\langle b\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(Y)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;Y\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;|\\mathfrak B|)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;|\\mathfrak B|)\\;\n(E\\subseteq Y\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(E)\\lor\\mathrm{Finite}(Y\\setminus E)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,1+m}\\;\\exists\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak A|^m\\;\n\\Bigl[D=D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak A}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\\to\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\n&amp;=\\left\\{\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak B|:\\langle b\\rangle\\in E\\}:E\\in\\operatorname{Def}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\right\\},\\\\\nD_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}\n&amp;=\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak B|:\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\langle b\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(Y)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;Y\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;|\\mathfrak B|)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;|\\mathfrak B|)\\;\n(E\\subseteq Y\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(E)\\lor\\mathrm{Finite}(Y\\setminus E)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,1+m}\\;\\exists\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak A|^m\\;\n\\Bigl[D=D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak A}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\\to\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强极小要求在所有初等扩张中仍为无限且每个带参数可定义子集有限或余有限，仅检查当前结构定义的是 minimal。UnDef 显式将一元组集解码为元素集，不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^1=A\">\\(A^1=A\\)</span>。本地补充的现代术语，原书精确来源尚未定位。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"