\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\subseteq\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak B|^1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,1+m}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak B|^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b\\rangle\\mathbin{{}^\\frown}\\bar c","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{UnDef}_1, D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B},\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\n&=\\left\\{\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak B|:\\langle b\\rangle\\in E\\}:E\\in\\operatorname{Def}_1(\\mathfrak B;X)\\right\\},\\\\\nD_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}\n&=\\{b\\in|\\mathfrak B|:\\mathfrak B\\models\\varphi[\\langle b\\rangle\\frown\\bar c]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(Y)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&Y\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;|\\mathfrak B|)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall E\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak B;|\\mathfrak B|)\\;\n(E\\subseteq Y\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(E)\\lor\\mathrm{Finite}(Y\\setminus E)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Form}_{L,1+m}\\;\\exists\\bar c\\in|\\mathfrak A|^m\\;\n\\Bigl[D=D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak A}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak A\\preceq_L\\mathfrak B\\to\\operatorname{Minimal}_{\\mathfrak B}(D_{\\varphi,\\bar c}^{\\mathfrak B}))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"A^1=A","display":false}],"bytes":3428,"backlinks":[{"id":"b93c3fbca33bcd2e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$；$Y,C,D\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$，$X\\subseteq D$。元素层可定义集族 $\\operatorname{UnDef}_1$ 见 [[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]，有限性见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。$\\operatorname{acl}_{\\mathfrak A}:\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|)\\to\\mathcal P(|\\mathfrak A|)$ 在任意结构上定义。$\\operatorname{cl}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}$ 的输入域为 $\\mathcal P(D)$；$\\operatorname{Ind}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}$ 与 $\\operatorname{Basis}_{\\mathfrak A,D,C}$ 是定义在 $\\mathcal P(D)$ 上的集合谓词。这里不预先假定强极小性；交换律和维数单值性另有显式假设。"},{"id":"a7584f09844a93bb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)$，$C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$，$D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)$，见 [[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]。$\\operatorname{acl},\\operatorname{cl},\\operatorname{Ind},\\operatorname{Basis}$ 取 [[17-df-algebraic-closure]]；$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ 和 $|X|$ 见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。在 [[17-ax-zfc]] 中工作。交换律见 [[17-thm-strongly-minimal-exchange]]。下式先断言基的存在与等势，再定义单值的基数函数 $\\dim_{\\mathfrak A,C}(D)$；无基参数记号 $\\dim_{\\mathfrak A}(D)$ 仅在 $D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;\\varnothing)$ 时定义。"},{"id":"a09db7c2dab60d0a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak{A}}$ (strongly minimal definable-set predicate, see [[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]])"},{"id":"1ceb182c9aa75eb2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\operatorname{StronglyMinimal}_{\\mathfrak A}(D)$，$C\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$，$D\\in\\operatorname{UnDef}_1(\\mathfrak A;C)$，见 [[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-strongly-minimal-set]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-125","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-